Xurol
$cards
DECK 1 {SPADES, CLUBS}

$initial
FRAEB 10 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
FRAEB 6 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
FRAEB 5 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
FRAEB 5 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

$moves
MOVE FRAEB FRAEB
OR
    AND
        DEST Empty
        DESTSRC Rank add_14
    DESTSRC Rank ascending
MOVE_STACK FRAEB FRAEB
AND
    SRC Rank 1
    OR
        SRCSTACK Suit match_color
        SRCSTACK Size > 3
$win
PILE ALL FRAEB Empty
